#29302
Chamber of Ascension~
   You have never felt closer to ascension!  This chamber stretches out to
infinity, assaulting your equilibrium.  Counter to the vast blankness of the
space, an altar dominates one side of the chamber.  The other side houses crates
and shelves stocked with supplies and what looks to be a disgruntled shopkeeper.
Straight ahead all that lies between you and infinity floats a glowing being,
beckoning you towards her.
~
