#29303
The Mortal Gateway~
   Those who have not yet earned the right to ascend gather here.  A faint smell
of blood pollutes the air, a constant reminder of the fragility and struggles of
mortality.  Chained to the wall is a pale-white, disfigured being that radiates
a strange aura, sending shivers down your spine.
